  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1001.13 Non-Driver Identification Card",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1001.13 “Non-Driver Identification Card” means a photo identification card issued to NH residents who do not qualify for or currently have a valid driver license.\n\nSource. #13685, eff 8-5-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 1000)",
